### get all Participants
GET http://localhost:3000/api/participant


### get one Participant
GET http://localhost:3000/api/participant/2

### create a new Participant
POST http://localhost:3000/api/participant
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Julian",
  "lastName": "Alvarez",
  "email": "ja@example.com",
  "identityDocument": "77777",
  "password": "araña"
}


### update a Participant (PUT - full, idempotent resource)
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/participant/2
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Jimena",
  "lastName": "Rodriguez",
  "email": "jimena.rodriguez@example.com",
  "identityDocument": "87654321",
  "password": "luli"
}

### update a Participant (PATCH - partial resource)
PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/participant/2
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Chimi"
}

### delete a Participant
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/participant/2